   "subject": "different priors for GLM",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi to all,<div><br></div><div>I&#39;m new at INLA, I&#39;m studying on the official documentation and apply some techniques to a problem of logistic regression model.</div><div><br></div><div>I have 4 variables in my dataframe df: OUTCOME (0/1) that is my dependent variable Y, AGE, CLASS, INCOME and I would like to fit a model like:</div><div><br></div><div>logit(y_i) = beta_0 + beta_1 * AGE + beta_2 *CLASS + beta_3 * INCOME</div><div><br></div><div>As I would do in Jags, I would like to put a Cauchy (0,10) prior on beta_0 and t-student on beta_1, beta_2 and beta_3.</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m quite confused when facing up with random and fixed effect on the priors. How can I explicit separate priors for intercept and coefficient of the covariates?</div><div>I did:</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:0.85em 1em;border-width:initial;border-style:none;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;color:rgb(51,51,51);overflow:auto;background:rgb(247,247,247);letter-spacing:0.2px\"><span style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration-line:inherit;background-color:initial;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px\">HT.prior =</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line:inherit;background-color:initial;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> &quot;expression:</span><br></pre></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:rgb(51,51,51);overflow:auto;padding:0.85em 1em;background:rgb(247,247,247);letter-spacing:0.2px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:inherit;background:0px 0px;display:inline;max-width:initial;overflow:initial;line-height:inherit\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-2\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935467000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1G2XOLTn0MMRw47iaW-R_k\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  sigma = exp(-theta/2);</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-3\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935467000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kHnQoXvgdvdpLCB93IXaG\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  nu = 3;</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-4\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935467000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-SitbWyPSQcO3YiSm0gAv\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  log_dens = 0 - 0.5 * log(nu * pi) - (-0.1207822);</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-5\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-5&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935467000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3w0kv31BYn4ajVhcADKMon\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  log_dens = log_dens - 0.5 * (nu + 1) * log(1 + sigma * sigma);</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-6\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-6&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935467000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2lxJB_IQQI7UTjOSWyqXEN\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  log_dens = log_dens - log(2) - theta / 2;</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-7\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-7&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935467000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1RSbk-k9HTebTKrCp36-jW\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  return(log_dens);</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-8\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935467000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1u8Iav0Ub57wR_0QeplKKQ\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>inla_model &lt;- inla ( Y ~ AGE + CLASS + INCOME , data=df, family=&#39;binomial&#39;,control_family=list=(hyper=<span style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration-line:inherit;background-color:initial;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px\">HT.prior</span>)).</div><div><br></div><div>But It doesn&#39;t work.. where do I have to put prior on intercept and coefficients of covariates?</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
