   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Hi,<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I&#39;m quite confused when facing up with random and fixed effect on the priors. How can I explicit separate priors for intercept and coefficient of the covariates?</div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><div><div>First of all, you can check ?INLA::control.fixed to see how the prior mean and precision of the intercept and fixed effects are defined.</div><div><br></div><div>You can also use the latent effect ‘linear’ [1] to define a fixed effect in the linear predictor using the ‘f’-function. This way you can choose the prior on the coefficient to be other than Gausssian. For the intercept you could use a covariate with values equal to 1 and the ‘liner’ latent effect, but remember to remove the default intercept in the linear predictor.</div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I did:</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:0.85em 1em;border-width:initial;border-style:none;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;color:rgb(51,51,51);overflow:auto;background:rgb(247,247,247);letter-spacing:0.2px\"><span style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration-line:inherit;background-color:initial;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px\">HT.prior =</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line:inherit;background-color:initial;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px;box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\"> &quot;expression:</span><br></pre></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:rgb(51,51,51);overflow:auto;padding:0.85em 1em;background:rgb(247,247,247);letter-spacing:0.2px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;break-inside:avoid;direction:ltr;border-width:initial;border-style:none;color:inherit;background:0px 0px;display:inline;max-width:initial;overflow:initial;line-height:inherit\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-2\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32Uy4ZYnu5bOOSZvNPdbmO\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  sigma = exp(-theta/2);</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-3\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dcLnruIrpk8gAVDi52UNh\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  nu = 3;</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-4\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VH7S7-scc3ESYTS0IlDFn\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  log_dens = 0 - 0.5 * log(nu * pi) - (-0.1207822);</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-5\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-5&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26S3u2xgIp3iVU9NT7X7TP\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  log_dens = log_dens - 0.5 * (nu + 1) * log(1 + sigma * sigma);</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-6\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-6&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0mFNMr6BjSO5oHcQCw7Ywk\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  log_dens = log_dens - log(2) - theta / 2;</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-7\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-7&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2j5tVVO1DA-BMX2Ris2nRL\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">  return(log_dens);</span></span>\r\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;text-decoration:inherit;display:inline-block;line-height:1.25\"><a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#cb181-8\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(65,131,196);background:0px 0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23cb181-8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ifk18QWC8pGKNn-tPM_h9\"></a><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(64,112,160)\">&quot;</span></span></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>inla_model &lt;- inla ( Y ~ AGE + CLASS + INCOME , data=df, family=&#39;binomial&#39;,control_family=list=(hyper=<span style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration-line:inherit;background-color:initial;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre;letter-spacing:0.2px\">HT.prior</span>)).</div><div><br></div><div>But It doesn&#39;t work.. where do I have to put prior on intercept and coefficients of covariates?</div></div></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><div>This is a prior on the precision to have a half-T prior on the standard deviation [2]. BTW, I spotted some typos in the name of the half-catchy and half-t priors. It should be HT and not HN as this is for the half-normal.</div><div><br></div><div>In your code, I believe that you must use something like</div><div><br></div><div>control.family = list(hyper = list(prec = HT.prior)))</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Virgilio</div></div><br></div><div><br></div><div>[1] <a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-mixed.html#linear-fixed-effect\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-mixed.html%23linear-fixed-effect&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0cAY1rVYlIv2prwG5sA8bM\">https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-mixed.html#linear-fixed-effect</a></div><div><br></div><div>[2] <a href=\"https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#example\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html%23example&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792440935473000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jySQnGdfEG68fDWf4BYIW\">https://becarioprecario.bitbucket.io/inla-gitbook/ch-priors.html#example</a></div><div><br></div></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
